  "goodToKnow": "Die Insolvenz is insolvency: Insolvenz anmelden (to file for insolvency), das Insolvenzverfahren (insolvency proceedings), der Insolvenzverwalter (administrator). Since 1999 the term has officially replaced der Konkurs, though Bankrott and pleite are still used casually: Die Firma ist pleite. Individuals can go through a Privatinsolvenz, which usually lasts three years. Insolvent means insolvent. From Latin solvere (to pay, loosen)."
